'''Wasskah''', also known as the '''forest moon of Trandosha''', was a [[moon]] that orbited the [[planet]] [[Trandosha]] within the [[Kashyyyk system]] of the [[Mytaranor sector]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]. Located in [[Standard Galactic Grid|grid coordinates]] P-9, the moon had islands covered in dense [[forest]]. Wasskah was owned by a [[Garnac's hunting guild|hunting guild]] led by the [[Trandoshan]] [[Garnac]], who used [[Island Four]], one of the moon's islands, as a [[hunting]] ground for [[Sentience|sentient]] prey. It was here that the [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]] was brought after being captured by [[Lo-Taren]] to be killed for sport. Tano managed to escape, however, with the help of some surviving [[youngling]]s, the [[Wookiee]]s [[Chewbacca]] and [[Tarfful]], and the [[bounty hunter]] [[Sugi (bounty hunter)|Sugi]].

==Description==
[[File:Trandosha_from_Wasskah.png|thumb|left|250px|Trandosha as seen from Wasskah]]
Wasskah was a [[moon]] of the [[planet]] [[Trandosha]], located within the [[Kashyyyk system]] in the [[Mytaranor sector]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]].<ref name="Ultimate SW" /> It was located within [[Standard Galactic Grid]] coordinates P-9.<ref name="Grid Coordinates" /> The moon had a breathable [[atmosphere]] to several species, and its surface had islands covered in thorny [[forest]]s with sandy beaches and massive pointed rock formations. The moon had a [[Color|green]] hue when viewed from [[Realspace|space]]. The [[forest]]s formed by [[Rancor bramble]] were home to the [[convor]],<ref name="PL" /> [[momong]],<ref name="WH" /> and [[insect]]s,<ref name="PL" /> along with the [[Marina Rung flower]].<ref name="TVE" />

==History==
During the [[Clone Wars]] between the [[Galactic Republic]] and the secessionist [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]],<ref name="PL" /> Wasskah was controlled by the [[Garnac's hunting guild|hunting guild]]<ref name="Ultimate SW" /> led by the [[Trandoshan]] [[Garnac]], who used it as a [[hunting]] ground for [[Sentience|sentient]] prey. [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]] was abducted from the planet [[Felucia]] during a [[Second Battle of Felucia|battle]] by the hunter [[Lo-Taren]] and brought to Wasskah. Taken to [[Island Four]] and released so she could be hunted down, Tano met with a group of [[Jedi Initiate|Jedi]] [[youngling]]s, led by the distraught [[Corellian]] [[Kalifa]]. Kalifa was eventually [[Death|slain]] by the Trandoshans, forcing Tano to lead the remaining survivors.<ref name="PL" />

[[File:WasskahShipCrash-WookieeHunt.jpg|thumb|right|250px|The Trandoshan slave ship crashes onto the beach.]]As Tano and the younglings [[Battle on Wasskah|fought]] to stay alive, the Trandoshans brought a new victim to the moon aboard their [[HCT-2001 Dragonboat-class Reugeot 905 freighter|prisoner ship]]. However, their [[transport]] was damaged when Tano and the younglings [[O-Mer]] and [[Jinx]] attacked it. The [[prisoner]], the [[Wookiee]] [[Chewbacca]], was able to flee with the younglings. The Wookiee suggested that they find parts to build a [[transmitter]] and call for help. They acquired the needed parts from the wreckage of the ship, and took the Trandoshan [[Smug]] hostage in the process. With Smug's forced help, the survivors commandeered a Trandoshan hunting pod and made their way to the Trandoshan's [[Ubrikkian Floating Fortress|floating hunting lodge]]. After an intense fight, the [[starship]] ''[[Halo]]'' arrived, carrying the Wookiee warrior [[General]] [[Tarfful]]. After receiving a [[Distress signal|distress call]] from Chewbacca, Tarfful had hired the services of the [[bounty hunter]] [[Sugi (bounty hunter)|Sugi]] in order to enact a rescue mission. Tarfful and the Wookiees under his command disposed, successfully rescuing Tano, Chewbacca, and the younglings.<ref name="WH" />

==Inhabitants==
Wasskah was owned by Garnac and his hunting guild, and they had operations set up on Island Four. Their prisoners also dwelt on the island for as long as it took the Trandoshans to hunt them down and kill them.<ref name="PL" /> The Trandoshan bounty hunter [[Mundokk]] hailed from Wasskah and operated during the early reign of the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Gamble">''[[Ezra's Gamble]]''</ref>

==Locations==
===Island Four===
{{Main|Island Four}}
[[File:IslandFour.png|thumb|right|250px|The forest covered Island Four on Wasskah]]
Island Four was a base of operations for Garnac's hunting guild, and it was here that the hunters let Padawan Tano,<ref name="PL" /> Chewbacca,<ref name="WH" /> and the younglings loose to be hunted as prey.<ref name="PL" />

==Behind the scenes==
Wasskah first appeared in the twenty-first episode of the [[The Clone Wars: Season Three|third season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'', titled "[[Padawan Lost]],"<ref name="PL" /> which aired on [[April 1]], [[2011]] on [[Cartoon Network]].<ref name="TVcom">{{TVcom|url=shows/star-wars-the-clone-wars/padawan-lost-1376181|text=Star Wars: The Clone Wars - Season 3, Episode 65: Padawan Lost}}</ref> The moon was first identified as "Wasskah" in the episode guide for "Padawan Lost" on [[StarWars.com]].<ref name="PL Guide">{{SW|url=explore/the-clone-wars/ep321|text="Padawan Lost" - ''The Clone Wars'' Episode Guide|nolive=1}}</ref>

